<title>GERMANY: Krupp chief joins Bertelsmann board.</title>
<headline>Krupp chief joins Bertelsmann board.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The chairman of steel and engineering group Fried. Krupp AG Hoesch-Krupp, Gerhard Cromme, has joined the supervisory board of media giant Bertelsmann AG, Bertelsmann said on Monday.</p>
<p>The appointment to the non-executive board, which has an oversight function and the power to appoint members of the management board, fills the gap left after the death of Friedrich Schiefer.</p>
<p>Schiefer, the former managing director of Robert Bosch GmbH, died in June.</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, 49 228 26097150</p>
</text>
